  "contentPages" : [
    "Name: Starklance
Gender: Male
Race: Glitch

The navigator of the ST Syllectis crew. Hailing from a rural Glitch town on a snowy planet, Starklance was always drawn to the stars and studied astronomy from young age, even though his peers did not share his passion. A chance encounter with a guild of spacefaring merchants allowed him to leave his old life behind and eventually join the Relic Seekers.",

"Although the realities of offworld existence presented a major challenge at first, Starklance's quick learning allowed him to adapt and become an expert spacecraft navigator.

Approaching any problem with a stoic mind, he often acts as the crew's voice of reason. He successfully keeps the space train safe from dangers of interstellar travel while also sparing time for his star mapping hobby."

